  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">INSO - Provision of security information and management to NGOs - II</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">INSO (International NGO Safety Organisation) provides critical safety, security information, and movement support to humanitarian organisations, especially in Northern Nigeria. Their services include daily security updates, incident reporting, movement coordination, and broader analysis that INGOs rely on to operate safely.</narrative>
  </description>
